  SYNTHETIC F9 FIXTURE. Not JLR evidence and not promotable to evidence.

  The Russian sibling of f9_dtc_descriptions.xml (ADR-0034, amended): the
  same codes and modules with the words in invented Russian. The index has
  no language element of its own, so the adapter reads the words — this one
  is mostly Cyrillic and must be accepted as Russian, and the English one
  must be refused as Russian. Exercised on purpose:

    * the generic P0100 and the module-scoped B1250 both have Russian;
    * B1250's second English wording has no Russian twin, so only the first
      is joined;
    * B1251 keeps its empty text and produces no claim, as in English.
-->
